# Secrets -- never commit
#
# PATHS ARE RELATIVE TO THIS FILE, i.e. to ansible/. Until 2026-10-12 the three
# lines below read `ansible/.vault_pass`, `ansible/files/pull-secret.json` and
# `ansible/files/*.secret` — copied from the root .gitignore, where that prefix is
# correct. Inside ansible/ they resolve to ansible/ansible/… and matched nothing.
#
# The secrets were never actually exposed: the ROOT .gitignore carries the same
# three lines and is in the right place for them, and `git check-ignore -v` names
# that file as the one doing the work. So this file was a second layer that looked
# like protection and provided none — which is worse than no second layer, because
# anyone reading it would stop looking.
#
# BACKLOG §7.1 (C7). Verify with:
#   git check-ignore -v ansible/.vault_pass
.vault_pass
files/pull-secret.json
files/*.secret
**/*.key
**/*.pem
kubeconfig
.kube/

# Local reference docs (not for git)
LAB-URLS.md

# Local state
*.retry
.DS_Store

# terraform / opentofu
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
terraform.tfvars
crash.log
